Package: adsalmd
Type: Package
Title: Adaptive Simulated Annealing Delineation of Local Labour Markets (AdSA-ALMD)
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Jamintha", "Samarakoon", email = "jaminthahashini@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Delineates local labour market areas (LMAs) from origin-destination
    commuting matrices and a spatial adjacency matrix, using a SARA
    (Spatially Adaptive Random Aggregation) initial partition refined by
    AdSA-ALMD simulated annealing and a deterministic misallocation-repair
    pass. Provides one-shot (run_adsa_pipeline) and parallel
    (run_adsa_pipeline_parallel) entry points that chain these steps.
